    "searchCoverage": "Official XMLAPI uses token+method+output=json against api.benchmarkemail.com. Pinned OpenConnector requires an arbitrary HTTPS baseUrl extra field. Current REST editions use clientapi.benchmarkemail.com (AuthToken) and api.benchmarkemail.io (X-API-Key) and are not this recipe. Pinned runtime rejects HTTP 200 Status=-1. Native bodyErrorPaths cannot distinguish Status -1 from success Status 1. Dated incident search on 2026-09-13 found no qualifying Benchmark Email compromise after excluding HIBP Benchmark (Serbia) and Benchmark Electronics.",
    "incidents": [
      {
        "date": "2026-09-13",
        "source": "https://www.benchmarkemail.com/jp/about-us/",
        "finding": "Bounded search of Benchmark Email / Polaris Software LLC / Benchmark Internet Group security breach coverage on 2026-09-13 identified no current unresolved customer-data compromise. Have I Been Pwned Benchmark (November 2019 Serbian technology news forum) and Benchmark Electronics ransomware claims are distinct companies.",
        "limitation": "This is not a breach-free claim. HTTP 200 Status=-1 remains inexpressible in native templates."
      }
    ],
    "remainingGates": [
      "operationQuality: pinned runtime treats HTTP 200 JSON Status=-1 as failure (src/providers/benchmark_email/runtime.ts). Native bodyErrorPaths cannot use Status because success Status 1 is a non-empty string and would false-fail. ErrorMessage/StatusText are not documented as present on every XMLAPI error, so they are not guessed as bodyErrorPaths.",
      "live authentication unverified"
    ],
    "waiverAuthority": "User waiver dated 2026-09-13 permits historical non-China incident coverage."
  },
